# WS2-10. # Sources: spec/03 §4 (partial moves only from owned locals and take parameters, E10026), spec/04 §3 (temporaries drop at statement end in reverse creation order; only the chosen ?: arm evaluates), spec/03 §5 (struct fields drop in declaration order).
Moving a field out of a call result is not a partial move of an owned
# local or take parameter, so E10026.
profiles: host
with: tok.clo
expect: reject E10026
contrast: let t: Tok = makePair(1, 2).a;\n    show(t); ==> let p: Pair = makePair(1, 2);\n    let t: Tok = p.a;\n    show(t);
contrast-expect: output
--- contrast-output
use 1
end
drop 1
drop 2
